description	"Phase I Dark Trooper

Lightly armored droid units that excel at ambushing and flanking their targets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Heavyweight
- Wrist Blade (Purple Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (3)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Q3
-- 50% less damage
-- 120% more special damage
-- 25% shorter
-- 400% thicker

^5Powers:
- Advanced Hydraulic Legs (Jump 2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Strength (2)
- BP-Free Jumps
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Getup (2)
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Beskar (1)
- Blast Armor
- Life Form Scanner (Miraluka 2)
- Assemble (1)"